                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Reaction: You declared the &apos;Endrinworks Outpost&apos; ability for a Zontari Endrin Dock</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is wholly within 9&quot; of that **Zontari Endrin Dock**, instead of resolving the effect of that &apos;Endrinworks Outpost&apos; ability, set up a replacement **^^Auto-Endrin^^** on the battlefield, wholly within 6&quot; of that **Zontari Endrin Dock** and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
